"title":"Create map marker icons","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":69},{"title":"Create info window field set","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":73},{"title":"Create a map overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":77},{"title":"Link overlay group and overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":81},{"title":"Create map marker icons","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":228},{"title":"Create info window field set","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":232},{"title":"Create a map overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":236},{"title":"Link overlay group and overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":240},{"title":"Create info window field set","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":337},{"title":"Create a map overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":341},{"title":"Link overlay group and overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":345},{"title":"Extension points in Field Service Management","target":"extension-points-field-service","line":477},{"title":"Field Service Territory Planning console properties","target":"territory-planning-components-fsm","line":481},{"title":"Create a map overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":485},{"title":"Link overlay group and overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":489},{"title":"Create a map overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":541},{"title":"Create a map overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":599},{"title":"Create a marker layer overlay","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":655},{"title":"Create info window field set","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":671},{"title":"Link overlay group and overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":691},{"title":"Create a map overlay definition","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md","line":724},{"title":"Extension points in Field Service Management","target":"extension-points-field-service","line":735},{"title":"Field Service Territory Planning components","target":"territory-planning-components-fsm","line":736}],"metadata":{"title":"Configuring a map overlay","description":"Configure a map overlay to view its corresponding data items in the territory map.Create a marker layer overlay to specify the data items associated with the markers on a map. You can set up markers for assets, locations, or points of interest.A shape layer overlay enables you to create custom shapes, such as polygons or lines, on a map. This type of overlay is useful for defining boundaries, illustrating routes, or highlighting specific geographic areas of interest.Create a heatmap to provide a visual representation of data density or intensity on a map using colors. A heatmap can help you identify areas with higher concentrations of data, highlight hotspots, and find patterns in data distribution.Create custom map marker icons for the marker type overlay.Create Info window field set to retrieve the field data from the database and display on a card when a marker is clicked on a map.Create a map overlay definition by linking the map overlay data items, info window field set, and marker icons \\(in case of marker overlay\\). The overlay definition appears in the map and is further used to view and filter the data on the map.Establish a link between the overlay group and overlay definition in the group usage table. This helps the overlay definition to appear in the Territory Planning console.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":19,"breadcrumb":["Configuring Field Service Territory Planning Console","CSM/FSM Configurable Workspace","Configure","Field Service Management"],"tags":["#field-service-management","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[175,332]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/field-service-management/configuring-map-overlay.md"},
